      {"id": "CUE-001", "start": 0, "end": 4.64, "text": "两个月暴涨十万，这种女性独居的vlog账号真的太吸粉了，而且内容非常好", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-001.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-001", "SHOT-002", "SHOT-003"]},
      {"id": "CUE-002", "start": 4.64, "end": 6.56, "text": "植入广子合作的场景也会非常的多", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-002.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-003"]},
      {"id": "CUE-003", "start": 6.57, "end": 11.77, "text": "今天三步就教你用ai做这样的内容，无需ps和ae有手就行，第一写分镜脚本", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-003.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-003", "SHOT-004"]},
      {"id": "CUE-004", "start": 11.77, "end": 15.12, "text": "我们把这一段提示词喂给ai帮我们写维老本分镜脚本", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-004.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id": "CUE-005", "start": 15.13, "end": 19.17, "text": "并且为每一个分镜写生图提示词，尽量让它多设计一些场景", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-005.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-004"]},
      {"id": "CUE-006", "start": 19.17, "end": 23.39, "text": "这样合作的时候也更好植入更多的产品，第二画分镜，我们先生成一个人物", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-006.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-004", "SHOT-005"]},
      {"id": "CUE-007", "start": 23.4, "end": 28.08, "text": "把刚才ai生成的提示词复制过来，你们可以暂停一下，复制我的提示词风格的话", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-007.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-005"]},
      {"id": "CUE-008", "start": 28.08, "end": 31, "text": "就直接找一张参考图来变好了，我们的女主角出来了", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-008.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-005", "SHOT-006", "SHOT-007"]},
      {"id": "CUE-009", "start": 31.01, "end": 34.65, "text": "选一张看着顺眼的就它吧，现在就可以生成具体的场景了", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-009.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-007", "SHOT-008"]},
      {"id": "CUE-010", "start": 34.65, "end": 37.2, "text": "注意这里要选上参考角色的特征和风格", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-010.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-008", "SHOT-009", "SHOT-010", "SHOT-011"]},
      {"id": "CUE-011", "start": 37.21, "end": 40.37, "text": "这样就能保持画面一致性，很快啊，几张分镜就画完了", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-011.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-011", "SHOT-012", "SHOT-013", "SHOT-014", "SHOT-015"]},
      {"id": "CUE-012", "start": 40.37, "end": 46.39, "text": "第三剪辑把这几张素材拖进来再加一些音效，比如窗外的鸟叫，刷牙流水声之类的", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-012.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-015", "SHOT-016"]},
      {"id": "CUE-013", "start": 46.4, "end": 50.24, "text": "再加一些动效和转场进来，再加一段治愈的音乐，稍微剪辑一下", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-013.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-016"]},
      {"id": "CUE-014", "start": 50.24, "end": 52.7, "text": "一段辅助vlog就做好啦，一起来看看成片", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-014.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-016", "SHOT-017", "SHOT-018"]},
      {"id": "CUE-015", "start": 58.81, "end": 60.975, "text": "关注我，每天教你一个ai技能", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-015.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-023", "SHOT-024"]}
